# TanStack Router

- Use `@tanstack/react-router` — never `react-router-dom`
- Routes are file-based; the route tree is auto-generated at `src/routeTree.gen.ts` — do not edit it manually
- Layout routes use `route.tsx` (e.g. `src/routes/_protected/route.tsx`)
- Dynamic params use `$id.tsx` (e.g. `src/routes/_protected/lists/$id.tsx`)
- Screen logic belongs in `-screen.tsx` files (e.g. `src/routes/_protected/lists/-screen.tsx`)
- Protected routes live under `src/routes/_protected/`
- Auth callback route: `src/routes/auth_/callback.tsx`
